B.cEI=new A.p("prioColumn",B.t,"priolanes2-0726: opt-in \u2014 switches to the 4-lane Now/Next/Queued/Later definition keyed by this column's own value instead of statusColumn. A row with no value here falls back to the status mapping (active->Now, queued->Queued, discussed->Later); unset (default) preserves the original 3-lane statusColumn-only behavior.",B.f,null)
