B.cOQ=new A.p("detailPopup",B.V,'Opt-in select-then-act model: tapping a marker or a point-list row animates the camera to that point and shows a small in-map detail card (label + detailFields + an "Open website" button) instead of firing the row action immediately. Default off preserves today\'s exact behavior (row action fires straight from the tap).',B.f,null)
