B.ctW=new A.d0("glmap","MapLibre GL vector map (real GL engine on every platform): table rows as tappable markers, plus optional multi-layer VECTOR tiles or bundled GEOJSON \u2014 circle/fill/line/heatmap layers over source-layers (or geojsonSources, fully offline) with zoom-ranged visibility, controllable live via the mapSetLayerVisible / mapSetFilter / mapSetPaint actions (target this node's id). Optional multi-pin navigation (pinMode/pinsTable + routing* props): tap-anywhere pin drop, a headless Dijkstra route between consecutive pins drawn as a polyline overlay, and per-leg walk/ride estimates for a UI card list below the map.",B.bmV,!1)
