B.cG1=new A.p("autoArrange",B.D,'Opt-in root-level auto-layout for a bubble with no stored posColumn value yet: "radial" arranges ROOT bubbles in overlap-avoiding concentric rings sized from bubbleSize, instead of the plain per-index ring fallback \u2014 so the map opens tidy. Nested bubbles keep auto-orbiting their parent either way. Re-runnable on demand via the `bublArrange` action (wire a "Tidy" button/menu item to it). Absent \u2192 unchanged per-index ring fallback.',B.byR,null)
