B.cOp=new A.p("play",B.V,"Opt-in auto-play/timelapse (default off): shows a play/pause button beside the slider that sweeps the value from the active range's start to its end, advancing by `step` (or 1/100th of the span when step is 0/omitted) every `playIntervalMs`, firing the SAME setting-write / action a manual change fires at every step. Pressing play restarts from the active-range start when the thumb is already at the end, otherwise continues from the current value. Any manual drag pauses playback in place (the `databars` play convention).",B.f,null)
