B.cWd=new A.p("addItems",B.X,'Extra typed "New <x>" actions beyond New file: [{label, icon, values}] \u2014 each stamps values on the new leaf (e.g. {kind:"doc"}); shown as one "New" menu. An entry may instead give {label, icon, action:{fn,args}} (e.g. Mokup\'s "New from template", firing instantiateTemplate) \u2014 the action fires directly and no leaf is created here, for an action that mints its own root row. `action` wins over `values` if an entry has both.',B.f,null)
B.cMI=new A.p("edgesTable",B.at,"Opt-in GRAPH/edges-mode: relations table (rows {from,to,type}) that resolves parent\u2192child instead of the single parentColumn \u2014 a node can have MANY parents (many-to-many) and shows under each. Null (default) = classic single-parent tree.",B.f,null)
