B.cOJ=new A.p("prioColumn",B.t,'Priority quick-set (priolanes2-0726): same idiom as statusColumn \u2014 a row\'s \u22ee menu offers "Priority: <value>" per prioOptions entry (plus a Clear item once set), writing it to this column (one undo step). Engine-generic; Dispatch wires it to `prioLane`.',B.f,null)
