B.cF2=new A.p("projectOverview",B.V,"Opt-in PER-PROJECT overview dashboard \u2014 a third Tasks \u21c4 Overview segment in column 2's (contents) header, alongside the existing detailedView Directory/Detailed toggle. Off by default so no existing applet's UI changes. When on, selecting a project can switch its contents column to a computed bar/pie breakdown of every item in that project's contains-subtree. See overviewTagsColumn/overviewTypeColumn for the two breakdown columns.",B.f,null)
B.cSc=new A.p("valueLabels",B.X,"Opt-in raw-value \u2192 display map for rendered DATA VALUES (tree row status/tag chips, the projectOverview by-status/by-tag/by-type chart bucket labels): {raw: text-or-{lang:text}} or column-keyed {column: {raw: ...}}, resolved against the ambient locale; unmapped values render exactly as before (passthrough, never blank). Display-only \u2014 stored values, filter payloads and tag `colors` keys stay RAW.",B.f,null)
B.cPh=new A.p("overviewTagsColumn",B.t,"projectOverview: the multi-value (List<String>) column the overview's \"by tag\" bar chart buckets on \u2014 each item can carry more than one tag, so every tag it holds counts once in that tag's bucket (a scalar column works too; each row then counts once under its own value). Unset hides the tag breakdown.",B.f,null)
B.cUQ=new A.p("overviewTypeColumn",B.t,'projectOverview: the scalar column the overview\'s "by type" bar chart buckets on (e.g. group/task/note/goal/milestone/...). Unset hides that breakdown.',B.f,null)
B.cU3=new A.p("overviewMarkerColumns",B.kb,"projectOverview: boolean columns (e.g. bottleneck/blocked) whose true value marks an item as needing attention in the overview's \"Needs attention\" section \u2014 one group per configured column, titled by that column's own schema label. Empty (default) adds no marker groups; the no-responsible-person and stale groups are always generic and still show.",B.f,null)
B.cLS=new A.p("overviewDueColumn",B.t,"projectOverview: the date column read for the overview's Overdue needs-attention group. Unset skips the Overdue group entirely.",B.f,null)
B.cQ8=new A.p("overviewLogColumn",B.t,"projdash-0810 fix-forward: boolean column marking a descendant as LOG CHATTER (an entrythread comment/reply) rather than a first-class project item \u2014 the SAME column an entrythread node's own opt-in `logEntryColumn` stamps true on every composed entry. When set, projectOverview's item population (`_overviewDescendants`) excludes flagged rows from the headline count, the status/tag/type breakdowns and the item list \u2014 a task with 300 log comments no longer inflates \"items total\" or the active-status pie. Unset (default) is a no-op: nothing is excluded, matching pre-fix behavior. Attachment-kind children (`leafAttachmentKinds`) are excluded unconditionally, no config needed.",B.f,null)
B.cT1=new A.p("activeStatus",B.D,'detailedView: statusColumn value counted as "active" in the active/queued split (default "active").',B.f,null)
B.cJ5=new A.p("queuedStatus",B.D,'detailedView: statusColumn value counted as "queued" (default "queued").',B.f,null)
